=\"H7272\"glorious|strong=\"H3513\".   \n"},{"number":14,"text":"The|strong=\"H3605\"sons|strong=\"H1121\"of|strong=\"H1121\"those|strong=\"H3605\"who|strong=\"H3605\"afflicted|strong=\"H6031\"you|strong=\"H3605\"will|strong=\"H3068\"come|strong=\"H1980\"bowing|strong=\"H7812\"to|strong=\"H1980\"you|strong=\"H3605\";  \nand|strong=\"H1121\"all|strong=\"H3605\"those|strong=\"H3605\"who|strong=\"H3605\"despised|strong=\"H5006\"you|strong=\"H3605\"will|strong=\"H3068\"bow|strong=\"H7812\"themselves|strong=\"H7812\"down|strong=\"H7812\"at|strong=\"H5921\"the|strong=\"H3605\"soles|strong=\"H3709\"of|strong=\"H1121\"your|strong=\"H3068\"feet|strong=\"H7272\".  \nThey|strong=\"H3068\"will|strong=\"H3068\"call|strong=\"H7121\"you|strong=\"H3605\"the|strong=\"H3605\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"’s City|strong=\"H5892\",  \nthe|strong=\"H3605\"Zion|strong=\"H6726\"of|strong=\"H1121\"the|strong=\"H3605\"Holy|strong=\"H6918\"One|strong=\"H6918\"of|strong=\"H1121\"Israel|strong=\"H3478\".   \n"},{"number":15,"text":"“Whereas|strong=\"H8478\"you|strong=\"H7760\"have|strong=\"H1961\"been|strong=\"H1961\"forsaken|strong=\"H5800\"and|strong=\"H5769\"hated|strong=\"H8130\",  \nso|strong=\"H1961\"that|strong=\"H1961\"no|strong=\"H7760\"one|strong=\"H1961\"passed|strong=\"H5674\"through|strong=\"H5674\"you|strong=\"H7760\",  \nI|strong=\"H7760\"will|strong=\"H1961\"make|strong=\"H7760\"you|strong=\"H7760\"an|strong=\"H1961\"eternal|strong=\"H5769\"excellency|strong=\"H1347\",  \na|strong=\"H3068\"joy|strong=\"H4885\"of|strong=\"H8478\"many|strong=\"H1755\"generations|strong=\"H1755\".   \n"},{"number":16,"text":"You|strong=\"H3588\"will|strong=\"H3068\"also|strong=\"H3068\"drink the|strong=\"H3588\"milk|strong=\"H2461\"of|strong=\"H4428\"the|strong=\"H3588\"nations|strong=\"H1471\",  \nand|strong=\"H3068\"will|strong=\"H3068\"nurse|strong=\"H3243\"from|strong=\"H1471\"royal|strong=\"H4428\"breasts|strong=\"H7699\".  \nThen|strong=\"H4428\"you|strong=\"H3588\"will|strong=\"H3068\"know|strong=\"